OL,3,AVictims 'grossly failed' by sex
OL,4,Aoffender bail decision
OL,5,
OL,6,FVictims and their families were
OL,7,F"grossly failed" by the court system
OL,8,Fthat bailed a sex offender and
OL,9,Frepeatedly allowed him to return to his
OL,10,Fhome overlooking the playground he
OL,11,Ftargeted, London's victims'
OL,12,Fcommissioner said.
OL,14,FZafer Dogan, 32, of Enfield, north
OL,15,FLondon, was jailed on Thursday for two
OL,16,Fyears and four months for taking
OL,17,Fthousands of pictures of children and
OL,18,Fusing AI software to "nudify" them.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
