OL,3,AXi got Trump's red carpet welcome - but
OL,4,Anot everything he wanted
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident Xi Jinping's summits with
OL,7,FDonald Trump have one clear aim.
OL,9,FChina believes the United States is
OL,10,Ftrying to contain its rise as a
OL,11,Fsuperpower, and it wants Washington to
OL,12,Fstay out of its way - particularly when
OL,13,Fit comes to trade, technology and
OL,14,FTaiwan.
OL,16,FOn this visit, however, despite Trump
OL,17,Frolling out the red carpet for him, the
OL,18,FChinese leader didn't get everything he
OL,19,Fwanted.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
